  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "One mole of a van der Waals' gas obeying the equation $\\left(p+\\frac{a}{V^{2}}\\right)(V-b)=R T$ undergoes the quasi-static cyclic process which is shown in the $p \\cdot V$ diagram. The net heat absorbed by the gas in this process is <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2014_phy_q14.png\">",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2q4kL",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left(p_{1}-\\rho_{2}\\right)\\left(V_{1}-V_{2}\\right)$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ic8du",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left(p_{1}+p_{2}\\right)\\left(V_{1}-V_{2}\\right)$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vJsMj",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left(A_{1}+\\frac{a}{V_{1}^{2}}-p_{2}-\\frac{a}{V_{2}^{2}}\\right)\\left(V_{1}-V_{2}\\right)$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hmhAd",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\rho_{1}+\\frac{a}{V_{1}^{2}}+p_{2}+\\frac{a}{V_{2}^{2}}\\right)\\left(V_{1}-V_{2}\\right)$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For the cyclic process\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2014_phy_a14.png\">\r\nHeat absorbed = Work done\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n=\\text { Area }=\\frac{1}{2}(\\Delta p) \\times \\Delta V \\\\\r\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(p_{1}-p_{2}\\right) \\times\\left(V_{1}-V_{2}\\right) \\\\\r\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(p_{1}-p_{2}\\right)\\left(V_{1}-V_{2}\\right)\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
